From fa5b1c3e0e721b59fed6db44bee0bb161e666265 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TEX8 Monero Patch Integrator <monero-patches@tex8.local>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:21:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] wallet: prefetch and cache public RCT distributions

Share exact-profile singleflight work outside wallet locks. Persist bounded checksummed public snapshots atomically, validate network and block anchors on every reuse, and refresh absolute cumulative tails without changing decoy selection. Cancelled or stale workers cannot publish. Keep signed RPC payment handling for explicit paid-node responses.
